From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Roos <thomas@roosesweb.de>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] relax setuptools requirement

Upstream caps setuptools < 83; OE-Core ships 84.0.0, which builds the
package fine.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe-specific]
Signed-off-by: Thomas Roos <thomas@roosesweb.de>
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 [build-system]
-requires = ["setuptools>=78.1.1,<83.0"]
+requires = ["setuptools>=78.1.1"]
 build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"
